cff-version: 0.1.0
title: digitscanlogs
message: A Go application for tracking and monitoring digitized document projects. This tool scans directories containing digitizing projects, catalogs files, computes SHA-512 checksums for integrity verification, and maintains a SQLite database of all scanned documents.
type: software
